49,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T06:16:18Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T06:16:18Z","body":"I'm taking this out of draft as it is working. This should not be merged until after we've updated the OpenXR version in the thirdparty folder to atleast 1.1.46\r\n\r\nOpinion among the XR team is to also hold off merging until Godot 4.5 has been released as accompanying changes on the vendor plugin side will require some guidance.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2928981062/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2938654800","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106891#issuecomment-2938654800","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106891","id":2938654800,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vKFBQ","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXN