ttps://api.github.com/users/insanepure/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/insanepure/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/insanepure/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/insanepure/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T10:15:35Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T10:15:48Z","body":"Have not particular tested this one, but if it works the same as khronos loader of the vendor plugin, it works for focus 3 for sure, as I tested it on there.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3531995547/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3532484581","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106891#issuecomment-3532484581","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106891","id":3532484581,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SjW_l","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T12:21:52Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T12:21:52Z","body":"> Have not particular tested this one, but if it works the same as khronos loader of the vendor plugin, it works for focus 3 for sure, as I tested it on there.\r\n\r\nThats the basic idea, it replaces the part of the vendor plugin where the khronos loader is included. This means that for any platform that doesn't require any additional manifest changes, you can create an APK that is deployable on all those platforms without requiring any additional plugins.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3532484581/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3535025904","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106891#issuecomment-3535025904","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106891","id":3535025904,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7StDbw","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T23:22:17Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T23:22:17Z","body":"I'm not sure the `pickFirst` thing is working to get the `libopenxr_loader.so` from the Khronos package, rather than the godot_openxr_vendor plugin.\r\n\r\nI tested exporting with this PR and godot_openxr_vendor v4.2.0 installed in my project, then I unzipped the APK file and took an MD5 hash of the `jni/arm64-v8a/libopenxr_loader.so` and compared that with the one from godot_openxr_vendors and the openxr_loader_for_android package. It had the one from godot_openxr_vendors!\r\n\r\nWhen I remove the godot_openxr_vendors plugin, and export again - then I see the right libopenxr_loader.so inside the APK","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3535025904/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3535471345","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106891#issuecomment-3535471345","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106891","id":3535471345,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SuwLx","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-15T02:59:10Z","updated_at":"2025-11-15T02:59:10Z","body":"> I'm not sure the `pickFirst` thing is working to get the `libopenxr_loader.so` from the Khronos package, rather than the godot_openxr_vendor plugin.\r\n> \r\n> I tested exporting with this PR and godot_openxr_vendor v4.2.0 installed in my project, then I unzipped the APK file and took an MD5 hash of the `jni/arm64-v8a/libopenxr_loader.so` and compared that with the one from godot_openxr_vendors and the openxr_loader_for_android package. It had the one from godot_openxr_vendors!\r\n> \r\n> When I remove the godot_openxr_vendors plugin, and export again - then I see the right libopenxr_loader.so inside the APK\r\n\r\nWell, its still better than completely breaking :)\r\n\r\nRight now I don't think it matters much which one is included, as long as we're not doubling up. We're not really using the loader beyond connecting to the runtime, we obtain all function pointers ourselves so even if we're using an older loader, things still work.\r\n\r\nIt's probably going to matter once OpenXR 1.2 is available but by that time we'll have removed the loader from the vendors plugin.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3535471345/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3536384638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106891#issuecomment-3536384638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106891","id":3536384638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SyPJ-","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-15T11:22:58Z","updated_at":"2025-11-15T11:22:58Z","body":"> Right now I don't think it matters much which one is included, as long as we're not doubling up. \r\n\r\nI guess that's OK, so long as it's predictable which one gets used\r\n\r\nBut if we did want to have it favor the loader from the Khronos package, we might be able to make that happen by switching to `pickLast` or changing the order the dependencies are listed?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3536384638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3537204947","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106891#issuecomment-3537204947","issue_u